      },
      "message": "fix(packaging): name the hicolor icons in the RPM %files list\n\nCommit 55c8bcc6 installs the logo in seven hicolor sizes under\n/usr/share/icons/hicolor/<size>/apps/camcraft.png, but the RPM spec's\n%files list did not name them, so rpmbuild stopped with \"Installed (but\nunpackaged) file(s) found\" and the v0.20.0 release run (43644441134)\nbuilt no Linux packages. One glob line in %files covers all sizes.\n\nFixes #1719\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
